# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python / editor / OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.DS_Store
tinker-env/
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Experiment outputs and generated datasets.
#
# Training runs write multi-gigabyte transcripts, wandb state, Inspect .eval
# bundles, and SFT/RL corpora built by the scripts in this repo. All of it is
# kept on disk locally but deliberately NOT published: far too large for git,
# and regenerable from the code + configs that ARE committed.
#
# The `!...*.py` negations below matter: a number of one-off analysis and
# plotting scripts live *inside* these run directories, next to the data they
# read. Those are source and are kept.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Top-level logs/ — keep summary results and analysis scripts only
logs/**
!logs/**/
!logs/**/*.py
!logs/*.jsonl
!logs/*.png

# Per-recipe run outputs
tinker_cookbook/logs/**
!tinker_cookbook/logs/**/
!tinker_cookbook/logs/**/*.py

tinker_cookbook/recipes/**/logs/**
!tinker_cookbook/recipes/**/logs/**/
!tinker_cookbook/recipes/**/logs/**/*.py

em_mitigation/logs/**
!em_mitigation/logs/**/
!em_mitigation/logs/**/*.py

# Generated training corpora
tinker_cookbook/recipes/**/data/**
!tinker_cookbook/recipes/**/data/**/
!tinker_cookbook/recipes/**/data/**/*.py

# Dashboard build output
dashboard/data/

# Stray duplicate of the reward_hacking recipe (wandb logs only)
tinker_cookbook/recipes/reward-hacking/

# Scratch run directory
.logs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Artifact file types — always ignored, wherever they appear.
# Listed last so they win over the negations above.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.eval
*.wandb
*.out
**/wandb/
**/preview.md
**/coverage.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local tooling, working notes, unpublished drafts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
**/todo.txt
tinker_cookbook/recipes/reward_hacking/ideas/
*.pdf
